user ask about sharing save files.  In general, binary files cannot be shared
between dissimilar machines.  One feature I would greatly appreciate seeing
in the next release is an XDR (external data representation) format of any
binary files so that multiple machine types can share an NFS-mounted
nethackdir.  Any comments on this from the dev team?
